      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively used workspace to retrieve records, and the patient later revealed hidden facts (gallbladder disease, endoscopy findings) through conversation (e.g., lite_evt_00051). However, the doctor did not explicitly integrate these discovered facts into the plan by mentioning carrying ultrasound/endoscopy reports or assigning specific hepatobiliary follow-up. The hidden facts were not meaningfully used to update the plan beyond the general advice. HO4 is partially satisfied because discovery occurred but integration was incomplete.",
