          "quote": "这提示肝脏可能存在持续性损伤。虽然您之前服用了保肝药但未复查，目前情况需要尽快明确病因。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 requires the doctor to recognize and communicate that ALT 658 U/L after >3 months without recheck demands prompt reassessment and that absence of jaundice does not make it safe to defer. The doctor's message lacks this explicit correction; it treats the ALT elevation as a routine workup need rather than a time-sensitive safety risk. No subsequent event in the trajectory remedied this. This is a serious omission.",
