      "explanation": "RC3 is partially addressed through workspace queries, but the specific information gaps (medication names, current LFTs, endoscopy/pathology reports) were not fully elicited before closure. However, the patient later volunteered some of the missing data. This is a minor error, but the more serious RC2 error already caps the grade.",
